<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Aries ends talks, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Aries ends talks, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African group Aries Packaging Ltd said on Tuesday that it had terminated negotiations referred to in a cautionary announcement published last week.</p>
<p>On September 30, the company said that it was in talks which, if successfully concluded, could have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution in share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
